---
/**
 * Privacy policy, English version.
 *
 * Provided for information only. Close translation rather than re-adaptation:
 * a legal document must say the same thing in both languages. The French
 * version prevails.
 */
import BaseLayout from '~/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import LegalPage from '~/components/LegalPage.astro';

const locale = 'en' as const;
const pageKey = 'privacy' as const;

const intro =
  'This policy describes how ALTARYS LABS processes personal data collected on altaryslabs.com.';
---

<BaseLayout locale={locale} pageKey={pageKey}>
  <LegalPage locale={locale} pageKey={pageKey} intro={intro}>
    <h2>1. Who processes your data</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>ALTARYS LABS</strong> is the controller of the data collected on this site.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Legal form: Société par Actions Simplifiée Unipersonnelle (SASU)</li>
      <li>
        Registered office: Abidjan, Abobo Biabou, Derrière la pharmacie Rédemption, Lot 3108 Ilot
        273, Côte d'Ivoire
      </li>
      <li>Company registration (RCCM): CI-ABJ-03-2026-B17-00070</li>
      <li>Contact: <a href="mailto:contact@altaryslabs.com">contact@altaryslabs.com</a></li>
    </ul>

    <h2>2. What data is collected</h2>
    <p>
      This site only collects data when you voluntarily complete the contact form. The following is
      then collected:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>your name;</li>
      <li>your company or organisation name;</li>
      <li>your contact email address;</li>
      <li>your contact phone number;</li>
      <li>the offering your enquiry relates to;</li>
      <li>the content of your message.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      The form is protected by <strong>Cloudflare Turnstile</strong>, an anti-bot mechanism. For
      that purpose Cloudflare processes technical signals from your browser, such as device
      characteristics or browsing behaviour, to verify that the submission is not automated.
    </p>
    <p>
      No other data is collected without your knowledge on this site: there are no analytics
      cookies and no advertising trackers.
    </p>

    <h2>3. Why this data is collected</h2>
    <p>This data is used solely to handle your enquiry, that is to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>get back to you;</li>
      <li>understand your requirement and respond to it;</li>
      <li>follow up on your enquiry commercially.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>It is never sold, transferred or used for advertising purposes.</p>

    <h2>4. Legal basis</h2>
    <p>
      Processing is based on your consent, given when you voluntarily complete the contact form,
      and where applicable on pre-contractual steps taken at your request.
    </p>

    <h2>5. How long it is kept</h2>
    <p>
      Your data is kept for as long as strictly necessary to handle your enquiry and the commercial
      follow-up arising from it.
    </p>
    <p>
      In line with the proportionality principle set out in article 35 of Ivorian law no. 2013-450
      of 19 June 2013, which requires data to be erased once it is no longer necessary for the
      purpose of the processing, ALTARYS LABS applies the following retention periods:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        if your enquiry leads to a commercial relationship, your data is kept for the duration of
        that relationship and then for 3 years after it ends;
      </li>
      <li>
        if your enquiry does not lead to a commercial relationship, your data is kept for 3 years
        from your last contact with ALTARYS LABS;
      </li>
      <li>
        technical data processed by Cloudflare Turnstile is kept for the periods defined by
        Cloudflare for that service, generally short.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      At the end of these periods your data is deleted or anonymised, unless a longer legal
      retention obligation applies, for example for accounting purposes or in the event of a
      dispute.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Where your data is hosted</h2>
    <p>
      Data submitted through the contact form is stored in a database operated by{' '}
      <strong>Cloudflare, Inc.</strong> and hosted in <strong>Europe</strong>. It is therefore
      transferred outside Côte d'Ivoire.
    </p>
    <p>
      Cloudflare is a processor providing contractual data protection guarantees. ALTARYS LABS is
      reviewing the relocation of this hosting to the African continent.
    </p>

    <h2>7. Who has access</h2>
    <p>
      Only authorised ALTARYS LABS staff responsible for commercial follow-up have access to your
      data.
    </p>
    <p>The following technical processors are involved, strictly within the scope of their work:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Cloudflare, Inc.</strong>: site hosting, Turnstile anti-bot protection and storage
        of enquiries;
      </li>
      <li><strong>Resend</strong>: sending notification emails for incoming enquiries.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      ALTARYS LABS ensures that these processors offer sufficient data protection guarantees and
      access your data only as far as necessary to perform their service.
    </p>

    <h2>8. Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      Under <strong
        >Ivorian law no. 2013-450 of 19 June 2013 on the protection of personal data</strong
      >, you have the right to access, rectify, object to and delete data concerning you.
    </p>
    <p>
      To exercise these rights, please write to{' '}
      <a href="mailto:contact@altaryslabs.com">contact@altaryslabs.com</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      You may also refer the matter to the{' '}
      <strong>Telecommunications/ICT Regulatory Authority of Côte d'Ivoire (ARTCI)</strong>, the
      Ivorian data protection authority, if you consider that your rights are not being respected.
    </p>

    <h2>9. Cookies</h2>
    <p>This site places no analytics cookies and no advertising cookies.</p>
    <p>
      Only cookies strictly necessary for the Cloudflare Turnstile anti-bot mechanism may be placed
      when the contact form is submitted.
    </p>

    <h2>10. Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>
      ALTARYS LABS reserves the right to amend this policy at any time to reflect changes to the
      site, its services or applicable regulations. The version in force is the one published on
      the site at the time of consultation.
    </p>

    <h2>11. Contact</h2>
    <p>
      For any question about this policy or the processing of your personal data, please write to{' '}
      <a href="mailto:contact@altaryslabs.com">contact@altaryslabs.com</a>.
    </p>
  </LegalPage>
</BaseLayout>
